1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,067
Ids, and nothing more
The page's sidecar names its personas by id. Nothing in it says who devin or maya is.

2
00:00:07,067 --> 00:00:16,633
manni meta get personas
meta get now prints a record line for each persona, with the file to read. No new flag.

3
00:00:16,633 --> 00:00:27,500
What a Read hands the agent
Key fields first, then one short line per record. The agent gets references, not the records.

4
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:43,300
A huge page fits the limit
The reply, 3,311 characters, stays under Claude Code's limit of 10,000 and names what it left out.

